      "comment": {
        "value": "The vessel is a spherical design built to accommodate only three people.\n\nOriginally intended for deep-water research, it played a crucial role in the final phase of construction and expansion of the Matvey station. Now inactive, it doubles as an emergency escape craft.\n\nThe Baikal has not been used for decades. It was powered by three large solid-state batteries, which were later disconnected and repurposed for other projects in the older station.\n\nA single remaining battery could potentially power the submersible to reach the surface.",
